; t18_debug.n — the debugging op quartet: dbg (peek top to stderr with the
; source site), check (one-token assert), timer (monotonic clock, ns),
; and memstats (gc stats dict). Raw timer values are never printed — the
; two targets keep different clocks — so the timer is exercised for
; bounds only; memstats is executed but never printed either (host heap
; counters legitimately differ).
; Expected: stdout "100\n"; stderr "dbg L9 [entry]: 42\n"
entry:
42 dbg
3 check
timer x!
30 'spin for
timer y!
y x sub 0 gt check
memstats z!
100 print
ret
spin:
1 1 add drop ret
